<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish July producer prices up 0.3 pct m/m-CSO.</title>
<headline>Irish July producer prices up 0.3 pct m/m-CSO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish output prices for manufacturing industries rose 0.3 percent in July and were down 0.3 percent from a year ago, the Central Statistics Office (CSO) said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Index (base 1985)     Monthly change     Yearly change</p>
<p>July 1997   120.3	    +0.3		  -0.3</p>
<p>June 1997   120.0	    +0.3		  -0.7</p>
<p>July 1996   120.7	    -0.2		  +0.8</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9775</p>
</text>
